#: src/api_client/upload.rs:321
msgid ""
"Check that the watched folder still exists and that the file was not moved "
"or deleted before upload."
msgstr ""
"Sjekk at den overvåkede mappen fortsatt finnes og at filen ikke ble flyttet "
"eller slettet før opplasting."

